  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eurocapital S.A.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operating in Chile since 1998, Eurocapital S.A. engages in recourse factoring operations, purchasing invoices, bills of exchange, checks, contracts, promissory notes, and other instruments issued by small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in the course of their operations. The proposed project consists of a loan of up to US$8 million.This IIC loan will enable Eurocapital to carry out factoring operations denominated in or indexed to the U.S. dollar, primarily involving sales of exports by SMEs that meet the IIC&#x2019;s eligibility criteria.Eurocapital has a 2.9% share of the local factoring market and 19 branch offices throughout Chile.</narrative>
  </description>
